Volatile : 
volatile is a modifier used with varibales.
It is also called as a non-access modifier.

It is used in multithreading where multiple threads access/share the same variable

syntax : 
access modifier volatile datatype variavblename=va;ue;

example : 
private volatile boolean runnning =true;

when a variable is declared as volatile , the thread will access the latest value written by theanother thread.

volatile helps us to provide visibility between threads,meaning,one thread can see the value updated by another thread immediately.